("the documented caveat of the hook ⚠ verify in the `useSyncExternalStore` reference. Suspense-mode query hooks work around this in library-specific ways ⚠ verify.","the documented caveat of the hook (the react.dev `useSyncExternalStore` reference says \"mutations to the external store cannot be marked as non-blocking Transition updates, so they will trigger the nearest Suspense fallback\"). Suspense-mode query hooks work around this in library-specific ways (not verified here)."),
