("⚠ library semantics differ; verify. Mixing them up","In TanStack Query 5.104 this is verified: `initialData: 'init'` was cached immediately (status `success`, no fetch with `staleTime: 1000`, one fetch with `staleTime: 0`), while `placeholderData` was never written to the cache and the observer reported `status: 'success'` with `isPlaceholderData: true` while `fetchStatus` was `fetching`. Other libraries differ. Mixing them up"),
